 Header Metadata:
 Form Number: (DHA-1712A) Form 12  
 Document Title: AFFIDAVIT IN RESPECT OF PARTIES TO PERMANENT HOMOSEXUAL OR HETEROSEXUAL RELATIONSHIP  
 Issuing Authority: Department of Home Affairs, Republic of South Africa  
 Legal Basis: Section 7(1)(g), read with sections 11(6) and 26(b); Regulations 3(2) and (4)  
 Gazette Reference: Government Gazette, 22 May 2014, No. 37679  
 PART A: To Be Completed in the Case of Initial Application:
 Particulars of citizen / permanent resident / foreigner:
 Surname & First name(s)  
 Residential address  
 Identity No. or Passport No.  
 Gender, Nationality & Date of birth  
 Type of permit, Date of first entry into the Republic & Date of expiry of permit  
 Particulars of foreigner:
 Surname & First name(s)  
 Gender & Residential address  
 Passport No, Nationality, Date of birth & Place of birth  
 Type of visa / permit held, Date of first entry into the Republic & Date of expiry  
 Relationship Declaration & Attestation:
 First declarant name and marital status selection (⁠unmarried⁠, ⁠divorced⁠, ⁠widowed⁠)  
 Second declarant name and marital status selection (⁠unmarried⁠, ⁠divorced⁠, ⁠widowed⁠)  
 Declaration choice (⁠make oath and say⁠ / ⁠solemnly affirm⁠)  
 Relationship type (⁠homosexual⁠ / ⁠heterosexual⁠)  
 Duration of relationship (Years and Months)  
 Undertaking of permanent relationship involving cohabitation, reciprocal financial/emotional support, and exclusion of any other spousal relationship  
 Attachment requirement confirmation for cohabitation and financial responsibility documentation  
 Children Particulars Table:
 Array capturing: Name of child, Date of birth, Name of mother of child, Name of father of child  
 Ongoing Undertakings & Signatures:
 Agreement to submit a confirming affidavit after two years from visa/permit issue date  
 Undertaking to inform the Director-General in writing if spousal relationship ceases  
 Signature of citizen/permanent resident or foreigner  
 Signature of foreign spouse  
 Commissioning of Oaths:
 Day, Month, and Year signed/sworn/solemnly affirmed  
 Place of commissioning  
 Commissioner of Oaths details: First name(s), Surname, Capacity, Office Stamp
